{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>目前，尚未有地面人員傷亡情況報道。</p>\n<p>美國聯邦航空局發佈聲明稱，這架「裏爾60」型飛機從德克薩斯州奧斯汀-伯格斯特龍國際機場起飛，目的地是巴哈馬。</p>\n<p>墜機視頻顯示，飛機從空中俯衝而下，在一條主要公路附近爆炸後，燃起巨大火球，不遠處有過往車輛。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"HWFFXxVXkAAApau.jpg\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1102/f627809f71681c9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"HWFE6-OW8AAR6-H.jpg\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1102/079dc2665cc4e9d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/spider20261102/590/w891h499/20261102/3b63-3be223147d67c065ea8a4908ac6f68df.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>目前，尚未有地面人員傷亡情況報道。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"HWFFXxVXkAAApau.jpg\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1102/f627809f71681c9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"HWFE6-OW8AAR6-H.jpg\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1102/079dc2665cc4e9d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:26.933482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:43:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:03.641416+00:00","content_hash":"9a741d2aa95463b19d46e2f317af1023e45e62b4da6668d9f7a2794eb5c2a441","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:26.933482+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}